## Plan Mode
You are in plan mode. Write tools are disabled EXCEPT for writing the plan artifact.

**Available tools:** FileRead, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch (read-only). FileWrite is allowed ONLY to the plan directory below.

**Your task:**
